<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Thai strings — a starter set, not the full translation.

  The language switch needs at least one translated locale to be worth
  anything: with no values-th at all, choosing Thai changes the configuration
  and nothing else, and there is no way to tell a working switch from a broken
  one. So the strings a rider meets first are here, and the rest fall back to
  values/strings.xml until the translation pass lands.

  Anything not in this file is not missing by accident — Android falls back to
  English per string, so adding a translation here is all it takes to switch
  one over.
-->
